- *
- * N rate:
- * (rx_status->flag & RX_FLAG_HT) = 1,
- * DESC_RATEMCS0-->DESC_RATEMCS15 ==> idx is 0-->15
- *
- * 5G band:rx_status->band == IEEE80211_BAND_5GHZ
- * A rate:
- * (rx_status->flag & RX_FLAG_HT) = 0,
- * DESC_RATE6M-->DESC_RATE54M ==> idx is 0-->7,
- *
- * N rate:
- * (rx_status->flag & RX_FLAG_HT) = 1,
- * DESC_RATEMCS0-->DESC_RATEMCS15 ==> idx is 0-->15
